WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.950
That's enough.
No more trying to outwit one another.

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:47.750
The cards are on the table.
Your choice is simple:

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:51.040
Give us Kankou Castle
and enter into a Chin-Sho alliance

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:55.080
or you and your companions
will be executed where you stand.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.750
One or the other.

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:03.410
Now, Chancellor Ri Boku... your answer?

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.000
Sadly, I have no chance of beating your price.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.290
Kankou Castle is yours.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:21.410
Excellent! The Chin-Sho alliance is concluded!

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.790
Shouldn't we be raising hell?

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:30.580
Even if we did... the stakes are too high.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:34.580
Ryo Fui was right:
this is no place for soldiers.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:40.330
So that's the monster you're fighting, Sei...

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:51.150
"A Tempestuous Feast"

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:06.000
With Ri Boku agreeing to hand over
Kankou Castle, the Chin-Sho alliance was complete.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.330
The meeting concluded without any mishaps.
To celebrate the new alliance,

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:16.370
a feast was to be held in a hall
on the grounds of the Royal Court.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.830
Here.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.580
Leave all your weapons here.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:34.160
What the hell--?

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.290
Amazin'!

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.410
Get a load of this, Kyou Kai!

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.080
Go in already.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:18.830
What's with the atmosphere here?

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:25.200
It's so grand and fancy,
but there's a definite edge in the air.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:29.450
Guess that makes sense.
It's not like just havin' an alliance

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.910
automatically makes everyone best friends.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:39.620
Hey, Sei's not here?
What could he be doin' that's worth missin' a feast?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.750
Wait a sec... there's no open seats!
We're too late!

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.910
There we go! Yesss!

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:07.250
<i>And</i> it's the seat with the biggest pile of food!

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.870
Okay, I'm diggin' in!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.830
I don't think you want to be sitting there.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.200
That's Ryo Fui's seat.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.950
He's stepped away.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:25.870
Ri Boku!

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:30.000
Dammit--my sword's out front!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.370
No... even if I had my sword,
I couldn't do it here.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:38.370
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.950
Our two kingdoms are allied now, you know!

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:46.910
That fool.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:58.370
Aw, shut up! I know, okay! I know...

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:04.370
...but the man who took down
General Ou Ki is right here in front of me!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:07.330
I'm warning you, brat--
quit looking at Ri Boku like that!

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.750
What rubbish!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.120
What's the point of a feast like this, anyway?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:16.700
This stupid alliance'll be broken in a year or two!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:17.870
Roku O Mi...

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.450
Not him again!

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:23.450
Weren't you combat commander
of the First Army under Ou Ki?

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:27.750
I understand you're not taking this alliance well.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:31.120
We don't have to put up with this! We're leaving!

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.790
Give it a rest, would you?

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.200
You think <i>we</i> don't have to grin and bear it here?

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:39.370
Everybody knows that once you're in an alliance,

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.830
you've got to turn a blind eye
and drink up--even with your sworn enemies!

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.040
What's <i>your</i> deal?!

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:49.040
H-Hey! Do you know who I am?

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.870
I don't care!

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:28.870
Those Ou Ki lackeys--acting with
complete disregard for our struggles...

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:32.750
It's no wonder they mock the
military officer, calling him a brat and a fool.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:39.540
What now?

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.620
Next!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.040
You're out of liquor.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.250
We're leavin'.

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:08.910
Nice! He was really tossing 'em back.

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:11.080
That's not the point.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:14.500
Aha... So that's Mou Bu.

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:19.410
He's not happy about this alliance at all, is he?

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:21.120
That's to be expected.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.660
Are you still at it?!

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:29.910
Look, I don't know who you are
or where you're from, but enough!

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:31.160
Stop glaring at Ri Boku like--

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.700
Shin! What are you doing?!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.000
You're being terribly rude!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.000
Shin?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:43.660
Not Shin of the Hi Shin Unit, by any chance?

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.620
What?!

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.290
How do you know about me?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:57.540
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit? How could I not?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.870
The special force that
took out Sho's General Fuu Ki...

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.910
...and the man who commands it?

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:08.700
I never thought he'd be a kid like this...

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:13.040
So you're <i>that</i> Shin.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:22.080
I see. Then I can understand
the malice you've been shooting my way.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.750
Wh-What's <i>that</i> supposed to mean?!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:28.580
You want nothing more than to kill me.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:32.000
To avenge General Ou Ki, yes?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:37.950
I heard about Ou Ki
giving you his poleax in his final moments.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:43.450
It's too bad.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:46.540
Too bad that I won't end up dying here today.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:12.580
Don't play games with me, Ri Boku.
No way do you think it's a shame you'll survive.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:19.080
The one who defeated Ou Ki
won't be dyin' in a dumb place like this.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:21.250
And the poleax isn't the only thing he gave me.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:25.910
I got plenty more from Ou Ki--major stuff, too!

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:33.450
I'm gonna be huge! Right now
I'm still commander of a 300-man squadron,

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:37.830
but I'm only gonna keep movin' up--
and my squad's gonna keep growin'!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:41.200
The whole world over is gonna know our names!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.160
So you listen here, Ri Boku...

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.790
Hammer this face

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.410
and these words

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:50.080
into your brain:

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:57.040
The one who's gonna kill you
is Shin of the Hi Shin Unit!

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:11.700
And you're saying this
at the alliance banquet, of all places?

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:21.500
All right. I have a good memory;
I'll never forget your face <i>or</i> your words.

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:22.500
However...

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:27.580
...defeating me is no easy task.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:34.540
In fact, unless you come to surpass
General Ou Ki, it's impossible.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:38.870
Don't worry... that's been the plan all along.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.830
You damned fool!

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:54.120
Begging your pardon, Chancellor...

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:58.160
Please... forgive his impertinence!

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:00.660
Let me go, old man!

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:02.790
What are we going to do with you?!

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.040
I said, let me <i>go</i> !

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.580
What seems to be the problem?

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.410
Has that child committed some offense?

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:13.620
No, that would be me.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.410
He's such a genuine young man

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:19.950
that I couldn't help but tease him
in a rather immature manner.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:24.370
But he can give as good as he gets, that one...

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:29.970
"Ka Ryo Ten"

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:36.700
The banquet continued,
awkward but lively in its way.

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:43.290
Toward the end, the topic
of the hostage Shun Pei Kun arose at last.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:46.700
The Sho contingent couldn't return without him.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:51.200
Ryo Fui's man Ei Kun
demanded another hostage in his stead

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.370
until they had Kankou Castle safely in hand.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:57.080
Thus Marquis Hei To,
a big player in Sho's financial world,

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.000
came to take Shun Pei Kun's place as hostage.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.660
Not another bite...

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:34.370
And so, the entire affair came to an end
without a single drop of blood shed.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:43.660
Ri Boku and the rest of the Sho contingent
put Kanyou safely behind them.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.700
Did something good happen, my lord?

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:53.950
Do you have to ask?
The negotiations went exactly as planned.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:14:00.500
That was bound to happen.
You don't get excited about foregone conclusions.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:03.500
How perceptive of you.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.120
I don't know how things'll go from here,

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.500
but I did manage to meet one promising individual.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.290
Kaine!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.410
Hi!

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.450
Who are...

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:23.200
Oh! Ka Ryo Ten!

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:26.200
Fancy meeting you here!

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:32.750
So it's been a year since we met in that battle...

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:39.450
Time flies, huh? I got myself in
a real bind, but I'm still glad I went.

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:44.290
If I hadn't gone to watch that battle,
I wouldn't have wound up in tactician school.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:47.410
You're in tactician school now? Huh.

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:48.080
Yep!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:53.080
Hey, so they let all of you
go home safe and sound. That's great!

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:57.910
Naïve as ever, I see. I'm your enemy, you know.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.580
And here you are telling me
you're going to be a tactician?

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.870
We ate together and even camped together.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.750
Enemy or not, I don't want you to die.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.700
Oh, is that so?

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:11.000
Besides, we're allies now,
not enemies--not anymore.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:17.870
Maybe for a year or two.
That's about the limit for a wartime alliance.

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:22.580
And Ri Boku says even <i>that</i> long is pushing it.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:26.580
Speaking of which,

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:27.620
aren't <i>you</i> kind of pushing it?

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:30.040
P-Pushing what?

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:32.830
You're starting to get pretty cute there.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.250
No way!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:40.200
And a little curvy.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.120
D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.290
What are you two doing?

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.620
Shin! Kyou Kai!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:50.160
Don't you be talkin' to her, Ten! Get over here!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:02.500
I got so worried when I heard
you two were asked to assassinate Ri Boku.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.660
Ha! Like we'd go along with that!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:10.080
These friends of yours, Ka Ryo Ten?

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:15.250
Oh, did you hear about Shin?
He and I used to live together--

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:18.000
And is <i>this</i> a friend of <i>yours</i> ?

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:21.870
Ever since I went to watch the Sho battle.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:26.700
I, uh, shared my food
with her and she... captured me.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.830
She's not a bad person, though.

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:30.450
Bad enough!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:36.620
So you're Shin.
That little confrontation with Ri Boku?

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:39.080
You're a stone-cold idiot.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:40.330
Why, you--!

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:43.950
That's right--there's not much time. Let's go.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.080
What do you mean, not much time?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.580
Just come with me already!

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:50.830
What's up with you? Sheesh...

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:52.700
Shall I stay out of this?

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.450
Yeah... if you don't mind.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:01.330
Sorry, Kaine--gotta run.

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.200
Yep.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:06.660
Take care! I get the
feeling our paths will cross again!

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:10.200
By then, we'll probably
be back to being enemies.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:10.950
Huh?

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.330
Just hurry up, wouldja?

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:14.660
Okay...

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:39.250
Hey, wait!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:41.660
Where are you taking me?!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.160
What is it?

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:47.370
We're here.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.040
Ten!

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:58.540
Sei!

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.540
Sei!

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.290
Ain't this a sight!
The Original Three, together again!

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:19.040
When you think about it,
this whole thing started with us three.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:21.250
We escaped your Kokuhimura Village hideout,

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.370
met up with Shou Bun Kun and all of them,

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:26.580
even went all the way
out to the mountain folk...

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:31.870
Hey, Sei... the power struggle
between you and Ryo Fui...

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:33.910
Has it gotten worse?

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:41.370
You didn't say a word at the meeting,
and you were a no-show at the banquet.

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:45.330
Honestly? It was like you didn't even exist.

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.830
Really?

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.830
They must really be holdin' you back, huh.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:55.080
If that's what it looked like...

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.330
...then it's working.

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:00.910
I have dared to play the fool.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:06.870
Once the real power is mine,
Ri Boku will be my greatest foe.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:12.200
So I diligently erased my existence
and kept him from knowing my inner self.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.950
It's something the sages
have done since time immemorial.

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.200
You heard him!

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:18.410
He's a sage!

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:23.000
Besides, we are putting up
a good fight at the moment.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:27.290
The efforts of Shou Bun Kun
and Shi Shi are coming along at a steady pace.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:32.620
In particular, Shou Bun Kun is getting
results on that tricky flood control project.

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:39.250
He often works alongside
a civil engineer by the name of Tei Koku.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:43.700
Shou Bun Kun? That old guy, diggin' along rivers?

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:49.000
Yes. At first Ryo Fui
pressed the dirty job upon him,

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.870
but now he works
to support Tei Koku as Minister.

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:56.790
I'd venture to say he is making
some significant achievements.

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:59.910
Huh! So the old guy's workin' hard, too!

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.830
But the Ryo Shi faction is pretty powerful...

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.700
Sorry, Sei.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.700
I'm in Shou Hei Kun's tactician school now.

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:14.950
Even though I knew
Shou Hei Kun wasn't on your side.

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:18.040
I'd heard about that. These things happen.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:22.080
You have nothing to worry about, Ten.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:25.870
I doubt the bonds we forged defying
death together in Sei Kyou's uprising

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.870
will be broken that easily.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.700
Yeah. Thanks, Sei.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.450
So your fight is movin' along too, huh.

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:43.330
Moving along, yes,
but one cannot be too optimistic about it.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:45.500
Their power is only increasing...

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:51.160
I have only five years' grace remaining.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:52.290
Five years?

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:55.790
Five years... but what does that--

00:20:55.790 --> 00:21:00.660
In five years I will be 22.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.410
Wait--so that means...

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:06.160
Yes: my crowning ceremony.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.910
The crowning ceremony:
a ritual performed as testimony

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:13.910
that a male member of the
royal family had come of age.

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.250
While other lands perform
the ceremony at the age of 20,

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.910
the proper age in the Kingdom of Chin is 22.

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:23.250
The ritual takes place in the
former royal city of You,

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:26.000
where generations of kings are enshrined.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:32.750
Once I am crowned, I will be recognized
as Chin's ruler both at home and abroad.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:37.790
When that happens, some in
Ryo Shi's faction are sure to come over to my side.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:42.330
Which is why Ryo Fui will absolutely
be coming to destroy me before then.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.160
I shall fend off his attempts,

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:50.370
and, in five years, take the ruling power for myself.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:59.160
But, Sei... five years
is practically no time at all.

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:02.700
This man at school, Mou Ki--he told us

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:07.080
that <i>ten</i> years wouldn't
be enough time for the Sei faction

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:09.870
to grow strong enough to fight off the Ryo Shi guys.

00:22:09.870 --> 00:22:12.660
Wrong! Five years is plenty!

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.080
Shin?!

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:16.250
We're not playin' around here.

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:19.830
You think they're gonna wait
ten years just because we ask 'em to?!

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:23.870
If they're comin' in five years to put
an end to this, that's when we fight!

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:25.290
But realistically--

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:27.620
Shut it! This isn't about "can" or "can't"!

00:22:27.620 --> 00:22:29.080
We <i>will</i> !

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:31.450
Right, Sei?

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:33.870
Exactly so.

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:36.870
And Shin--what about you?

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:41.790
Can you make general in five short years?

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:54.290
A general... in five years?

00:22:59.450 --> 00:23:01.500
If so, then five years from now,

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:06.500
the general I mobilize with my
very first command will be you, Shin!

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:57.930
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The King and the Ant"
